<view class="page">
  <view class="hero"><view class="brand"><image class="logo" src="/images/logo.png" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="heading">退费管理</view></view><view class="muted">家长申请 → 教务确认金额并已阅 → 管理员登记已退款。家长无需上传退款截图，也无需确认到账。</view></view>
  <view class="state error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}<button class="small" bindtap="onPullDownRefresh" disabled="{{submitting}}">刷新核对状态</button></view>
  <block wx:if="{{!isDetail}}">
    <input value="{{searchText}}" data-field="searchText" bindinput="input" bindconfirm="search" placeholder="按学生姓名查询" disabled="{{submitting}}"/>
    <view class="row"><picker class="grow" range="{{filters}}" value="{{filterIndex}}" bindchange="filter" disabled="{{loading || submitting}}"><view class="picker">{{filters[filterIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><button class="primary small" bindtap="search" disabled="{{loading || submitting}}">查询</button></view>
    <view class="card" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="refundId" data-id="{{item.refundId}}" bindtap="openDetail"><view class="row"><view class="title">{{item.studentName}}</view><view class="tag">{{item.statusText}}</view></view><view class="muted number">{{item.refundNo}}</view><view>{{item.kindText}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.reason}}</view><view class="muted">教务核定 {{item.approvedText}}</view><view class="safe" wx:if="{{!item.offline}}">{{item.workflowText}}</view><view class="link" wx:if="{{allowed.query}}">查看／处理 ›</view></view>
  </block>
  <block wx:if="{{detail}}">
    <view class="card"><view class="row"><view class="title">{{detail.studentName}} · {{detail.kindText}}</view><view class="tag">{{detail.statusText}}</view></view><view class="muted number">{{detail.refundNo}}</view><view class="muted number">报名编号 {{detail.enrollmentCode}}</view><view class="safe" wx:if="{{detail.financeMode === 'MOCK'}}">本地模拟记录，不涉及真实资金</view><view class="amount-grid"><view><view class="muted">原始实收</view><view class="value">{{detail.receivedText}}</view></view><view><view class="muted">本申请可核定上限</view><view class="value">{{detail.availableText}}</view></view></view><view class="detail-field"><view class="detail-label">教务核定金额</view>{{detail.approvedText}}</view><view class="detail-field"><view class="detail-label">申请原因</view>{{detail.reason}}</view><view class="detail-field"><view class="detail-label">教务审核</view>{{detail.reviewerName || '尚未审核'}} {{detail.reviewTime || ''}}<view>{{detail.reviewRemark}}</view></view><view class="detail-field"><view class="detail-label">退款登记</view>{{detail.executorName || '尚未登记'}} {{detail.completedTime || ''}}</view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{detail.refundKind === 'SESSION'}}">仅处理本次请假，退费时按原规则收回对应课次，其他课次保留。</view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{detail.refundKind === 'WITHDRAWAL'}}">仅退出本申请对应课程，不影响其他课程。</view></view>
    <view class="safe" wx:if="{{!detail.offline}}">{{detail.workflowText}}</view>
    <block wx:if="{{detail.offline}}">
      <view class="card review-form" wx:if="{{detail.refundStatus === 'WAIT_EDU' && allowed.review}}"><view class="title">第一步：教务确认金额并已阅</view><view class="muted">按实际沟通情况填写金额，不能超过可退范围。</view><input type="digit" value="{{approvedAmount}}" data-field="approvedAmount" bindinput="input" placeholder="核定退款金额（元）" disabled="{{submitting || loading}}"/><textarea class="review-note" value="{{reviewRemark}}" data-field="reviewRemark" bindinput="input" maxlength="500" placeholder="审核说明（驳回时必填）" disabled="{{submitting || loading}}"/><view class="actions"><button class="small" data-action="reject" bindtap="review" disabled="{{submitting || loading}}">驳回申请</button><button class="primary small" data-action="approve" bindtap="review" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting || loading}}">确认金额并已阅</button></view></view>
      <view class="card" wx:if="{{detail.refundStatus === 'WAIT_ADMIN'}}"><view class="title">第二步：管理员登记已退款</view><view class="notice">教务核定金额 {{detail.approvedText}}。请在线下实际退款后登记，不会发起微信支付或自动转账。</view><button class="primary" wx:if="{{allowed.markRefunded}}" bindtap="markRefunded" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting || loading}}">已退款登记</button><view class="muted" wx:else>等待有权限的管理员登记退款，教务不能完成此步骤。</view><block wx:if="{{allowed.adminReject}}"><textarea class="review-note" value="{{reviewRemark}}" data-field="reviewRemark" bindinput="input" maxlength="500" placeholder="如需驳回，请填写原因" disabled="{{submitting || loading}}"/><button class="small" data-action="reject" bindtap="review" disabled="{{submitting || loading}}">管理员驳回</button></block></view>
      <view class="safe" wx:if="{{detail.refundStatus === 'SUCCESS'}}">退费流程已结束。家长端已显示最终退款金额，无需家长继续操作。</view>
      <view class="notice" wx:if="{{(detail.refundStatus === 'WAIT_EDU' && !allowed.review)}}">当前账号未获退费审核权限，请在网页角色管理中检查授权。</view>
    </block>
  </block>
  <view class="state" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在加载…</view><view class="state" wx:if="{{!loading && !error && !detail && !rows.length}}">暂无退费申请</view>
</view>
